{"id": 2709, "title": "Dog’s Enemy", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK4"], "slug": "dogs-enemy", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/2709_dogs-enemy.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["狗站在镜子前，发现了一个敌人。它想：这个家伙自己从来没有见过，不知道它厉害不厉害，我先观察一下。但是它发现敌人也看着自己，并且好像一点儿也不怕它。", "狗有点儿紧张了，它觉得这个家伙肯定很难对付，所以决定吓唬吓唬这个敌人，于是它朝敌人叫了起来：”汪汪，汪汪汪。”狗以为这样敌人会被吓跑，没想到，镜子里的敌人也会朝它汪汪汪地叫。它在心里说：”看来，今天遇到真正的对手了。”然后它张开大嘴，露出了锋利的牙齿。因为在它的经验里，所有敌人都害怕它的牙齿。可是这个敌人不但不怕，还露出了更加可怕的牙齿。", "狗害怕极了，最后，它狼狈不堪地逃跑了。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["狗站在鏡子前，發現了一個敵人。它想：這個家伙自己從來沒有見過，不知道它厲害不厲害，我先觀察一下。但是它發現敵人也看著自己，並且好像一點兒也不怕它。", "狗有點兒緊張了，它覺得這個家伙肯定很難對付，所以決定嚇唬嚇唬這個敵人，於是它朝敵人叫了起來：”汪汪，汪汪汪。”狗以為這樣敵人會被嚇跑，沒想到，鏡子裡的敵人也會朝它汪汪汪地叫。它在心裡說：”看來，今天遇到真正的對手了。”然後它張開大嘴，露出了鋒利的牙齒。因為在它的經驗裡，所有敵人都害怕它的牙齒。可是這個敵人不但不怕，還露出了更加可怕的牙齒。", "狗害怕極了，最後，它狼狽不堪地逃跑了。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["gǒu zhàn zài jìng zi qián， fā xiàn le yī gè dí rén。 tā xiǎng： zhè gè jiā huo zì jǐ cóng lái méi yǒu jiàn guo， bù zhī dào tā lì hai bù lì hai， wǒ xiān guān chá yī xià。 dàn shì tā fā xiàn dí rén yě kàn zhe zì jǐ， bìng qiě hǎo xiàng yī diǎn r yě bù pà tā。", "gǒu yǒu diǎn r jǐn zhāng le， tā jué de zhè gè jiā huo kěn dìng hěn nán duì fu， suǒ yǐ jué dìng xià hu xià hu zhè gè dí rén， yú shì tā cháo dí rén jiào le qǐ lái：” wāng wāng， wāng wāng wāng。” gǒu yǐ wéi zhè yàng dí rén huì bèi xià pǎo， méi xiǎng dào， jìng zi lǐ de dí rén yě huì cháo tā wāng wāng wāng de jiào。 tā zài xīn lǐ shuō：” kàn lái， jīn tiān yù dào zhēn zhèng de duì shǒu le。” rán hòu tā zhāng kāi dà zuǐ， lòu chū le fēng lì de yá chǐ。 yīn wèi zài tā de jīng yàn lǐ， suǒ yǒu dí rén dōu hài pà tā de yá chǐ。 kě shì zhè gè dí rén bù dàn bù pà， hái lòu chū le gèng jiā kě pà de yá chǐ。", "gǒu hài pà jí le， zuì hòu， tā láng bèi bù kān de táo pǎo le。"], "english_paragraphs": ["A dog stood in front of a mirror and spotted an enemy. It thought, “I’ve never seen this fellow before. I don’t know how tough it is, so I’ll watch it first.” But the dog noticed that the enemy was watching it too and didn’t seem the least bit afraid.", "The dog grew a little nervous. It decided this fellow would be hard to deal with, so it tried to scare the enemy away. “Woof, woof! Woof, woof, woof!” it barked. The dog thought the enemy would run away, but to its surprise, the enemy in the mirror barked right back. “Looks like I’ve met my match today,” the dog thought. Then it opened its mouth wide and showed its sharp teeth. In its experience, all its enemies were afraid of its teeth. But this enemy wasn’t afraid at all—it showed even more frightening teeth.", "The dog was terrified. In the end, it fled in a panic."], "english_full": "A dog stood in front of a mirror and spotted an enemy. It thought, “I’ve never seen this fellow before. I don’t know how tough it is, so I’ll watch it first.” But the dog noticed that the enemy was watching it too and didn’t seem the least bit afraid.\n\nThe dog grew a little nervous. It decided this fellow would be hard to deal with, so it tried to scare the enemy away. “Woof, woof! Woof, woof, woof!” it barked. The dog thought the enemy would run away, but to its surprise, the enemy in the mirror barked right back. “Looks like I’ve met my match today,” the dog thought. Then it opened its mouth wide and showed its sharp teeth. In its experience, all its enemies were afraid of its teeth. But this enemy wasn’t afraid at all—it showed even more frightening teeth.\n\nThe dog was terrified. In the end, it fled in a panic.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gǒu\" data-defn=\"dog\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">狗</span><span class=\"tr\">狗</span><rt>gǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhàn\" data-defn=\"to stand / to halt / to stop\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">站</span><span class=\"tr\">站</span><rt>zhàn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zài\" data-defn=\"(of sb or sth) to be (located) at\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jìng zi\" data-defn=\"mirror\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">镜子</span><span class=\"tr\">鏡子</span><rt>jìng zi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"qián\" data-defn=\"front / forward / ahead\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">前</span><span class=\"tr\">前</span><rt>qián</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"fā xiàn\" data-defn=\"to notice; to become aware of / to discover; to find; to detect\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">发现</span><span class=\"tr\">發現</span><rt>fā xiàn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"le\" data-defn=\"(completed action marker) / (modal particle indicating change of state, situation now)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dí rén\" data-defn=\"enemy\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">敌人</span><span class=\"tr\">敵人</span><rt>dí rén</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"it\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">它</span><span class=\"tr\">它</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiǎng\" data-defn=\"to think (about) / to think of; to devise / to think (that); to believe (that)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">想</span><span class=\"tr\">想</span><rt>xiǎng</rt></ruby>：<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhè\" data-defn=\"this; these\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ru