d; tough / (of an animal) fierce / (of a resemblance) striking / (of liquor or chili pepper) strong / (of bacteria) virulent\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">厉害</span><span class=\"tr\">厲害</span><rt>lì hai</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bù\" data-defn=\"no; not so\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lì hai\" data-defn=\"(used to describe sb or sth that makes a very strong impression, whether favorable or unfavorable) terrible; intense; severe; devastating; amazing; awesome; outstanding / (of a person) stern; strict; harsh; shrewd; tough / (of an animal) fierce / (of a resemblance) striking / (of liquor or chili pepper) strong / (of bacteria) virulent\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">厉害</span><span class=\"tr\">厲害</span><rt>lì hai</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiān\" data-defn=\"beforehand; first; earlier / at first; originally / for the time being; for now\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">先</span><span class=\"tr\">先</span><rt>xiān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"guān chá\" data-defn=\"to observe; to watch; to survey\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">观察</span><span class=\"tr\">觀察</span><rt>guān chá</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī xià\" data-defn=\"(after a verb) a bit; a little (indicating brief duration, or softening the tone, or suggesting giving sth a try)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1(4)\"><span class=\"si\">一下</span><span class=\"tr\">一下</span><rt>yī xià</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dàn shì\" data-defn=\"but; however\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">但是</span><span class=\"tr\">但是</span><rt>dàn shì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"it\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">它</span><span class=\"tr\">它</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"fā xiàn\" data-defn=\"to notice; to become aware of / to discover; to find; to detect\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">发现</span><span class=\"tr\">發現</span><rt>fā xiàn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"dí rén\" data-defn=\"enemy\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">敌人</span><span class=\"tr\">敵人</span><rt>dí rén</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yě\" data-defn=\"also; too; as well; (not ...) either\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kàn\" data-defn=\"to see; to look at / to read / to watch / to visit; to call on / to consider; to regard as / to look after / to treat (a patient or illness) / to depend on / to feel (that) / (after a verb) to give it a try / to watch out for\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">看</span><span class=\"tr\">看</span><rt>kàn</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhe\" data-defn=\"aspect particle indicating action in progress or ongoing state\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">着</span><span class=\"tr\">著</span><rt>zhe</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zì jǐ\" data-defn=\"oneself; (attributive) one&#x27;s own\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">自己</span><span class=\"tr\">自己</span><rt>zì jǐ</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bìng qiě\" data-defn=\"and; besides; moreover; furthermore; in addition\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">并且</span><span class=\"tr\">並且</span><rt>bìng qiě</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hǎo xiàng\" data-defn=\"to seem like\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">好像</span><span class=\"tr\">好像</span><rt>hǎo xiàng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī diǎn r\" data-defn=\"erhua\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一点儿</span><span class=\"tr\">一點兒</span><rt>yī diǎn r</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yě\" data-defn=\"also; too; as well; (not ...) either\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">也</span><span class=\"tr\">也</span><rt>yě</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"bù\" data-defn=\"no; not so\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">不</span><span class=\"tr\">不</span><rt>bù</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"pà\" data-defn=\"to be afraid / to fear / to dread / to be unable to endure\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3(4)\"><span class=\"si\">怕</span><span class=\"tr\">怕</span><rt>pà</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"it\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">它</span><span class=\"tr\">它</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby>。", "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gǒu\" data-defn=\"dog\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">狗</span><span class=\"tr\">狗</span><rt>gǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu diǎn r\" data-defn=\"slightly / a little / somewhat\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有点儿</span><span class=\"tr\">有點兒</span><rt>yǒu diǎn r</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jǐn zhāng\" data-defn=\"nervous / keyed up / intense / tense / strained\" data-hsk=\"HSK 4\"><span class=\"si\">紧张</span><span class=\"tr\">緊張</span><rt>jǐn zhāng</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"le\" data-defn=\"(completed action marker) / (modal particle indicating change of state, situation now)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">了</span><span class=\"tr\">了</span><rt>le</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tā\" data-defn=\"it\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">它</span><span class=\"tr\">它</span><rt>tā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jué de\" data-defn=\"to think that ...; to feel that ...\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">觉得</span><span class=\"tr\">覺得</span><rt>jué de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhè\" data-defn=\"this; these\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" dat